---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Students & Families Portal"
  description="Instant access to timetables, room change alerts, and delegate voting. 100% free and ad-free for enrolled student members."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrlFr="/fr/etudiants/"
  alternateUrlEn="/en/students/"
>
  <section class="py-16 bg-slate-900 text-white border-b border-slate-800 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Student Experience Redesigned for Simplicity</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Check your courses, receive real-time room notifications, and vote for your class delegates.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 text-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
          <span class="text-3xl mb-4 block">📱</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Ultra-Fast PWA Web App</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            No need to download a heavy app from the Play Store. Pineapple OS installs with one click to the home screen of any Android or iPhone smartphone with minimal mobile data usage.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
          <span class="text-3xl mb-4 block">🚫</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Zero Third-Party Ads for Enrolled Students</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Once your institution subscribes to Pineapple OS, your app interface is completely clean and ad-free. Enjoy a focused academic environment without distractions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
          <span class="text-3xl mb-4 block">📢</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Instant Room Change Notifications</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            No more wasted trips to occupied lecture halls. Get instant push alerts whenever your delegate or academic office reports a room change or class reschedule.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
          <span class="text-3xl mb-4 block">🗳️</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Transparent Class Elections</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Participate directly in electing your class delegates. Review candidate manifestos and cast your vote securely in a transparent process.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
